UPDATE companies SET description='DPS Molding, Inc. operates from Vanceboro, North Carolina, where it specializes in advanced plastic injection molding technologies. The company focuses on manufacturing plastic products using innovative processes such as co-injection, gas-assist, and structural foam molding.

The shop runs co-injection and co-injection with gas assist alongside rotary systems, enabling structural foam molding for parts up to 10 kilograms (22 pounds). Its capabilities include component design with gas assist and the production of 100 percent recycled plastic heavy floor blocks and tiles, reflecting a focus on material reuse.

DPS Molding serves the furniture, brush, and construction industries, supplying custom-molded components designed for durability and high added value. The company positions its output at the higher end of the injection molding market, emphasizing thick-walled, high-performance parts over thin, low-cost alternatives.

The business distinguishes itself by treating recycling as a core capability, turning end-of-life products into new items through co-injection and structural foam methods that conventional injection molding cannot achieve. This approach aims to deliver superior quality and competitive costing for demanding applications.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Co-injection molding", "Co-injection molding with gas assist", "Structural foam molding", "Component design with gas assist", "Rotary systems for co-injection and gas assist", "Plastic recycling and reprocessing"], "industries": ["Furniture", "Brush", "Construction"], "materials": ["Plastic", "Recycled plastic"], "equipment": ["Rotary systems for co-injection and gas assist"], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Co-injection and gas-assist molding for thick, high-value parts", "Structural foam molding capabilities", "In-house recycling of plastic into new products (100% recycled floor blocks and tiles)", "Rotary systems for co-injection and gas assist", "Parts up to 10 kg (22 lb)"], "facts_used": ["Location: Vanceboro, North Carolina -> db", "Industries served: furniture, brush, construction -> db", "Capabilities: co-injection molding, co-injection with gas assist, structural foam molding -> db", "Processes: rotary systems for co-injection and gas assist -> page /", "Recycling focus: 100% recycled plastic heavy floor blocks & tiles -> page /", "Part weight limit: up to 10 kg (22 lb) -> db", "Differentiation: higher end of injection molding, thick high-value parts -> page /"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "PS molding Inc. focuses on manufacturing plastic products with the latest and most innovative technologies", "founded_year": "", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='dps-molding-