UPDATE companies SET description='Danfe Foods operates from Harrisburg, Pennsylvania. The company was established by a leadership team that includes CEO Khada Dulal and Managing Director Krishna Dulal, who were motivated by a passion for natural, unadulterated food. While the exact founding year is not publicly disclosed, the business began with a mission to bring ethically sourced, high-quality grains and spices to families.

The company produces a range of shelf-stable food products across four categories: lentils and beans (such as Chana Dal), flour (including Chakki Fresh Atta), spices (such as White Sesame Seeds), and ready-to-cook items like uncooked Pani Puri. Danfe emphasizes ethical sourcing directly from farms and hygienic packaging designed to preserve freshness and nutrients without additives, colors, preservatives, pesticides, or chemicals.

Danfe sells directly to consumers through its online store, serving households seeking natural, diabetic-friendly, and protein-rich ingredients. Customer testimonials highlight repeat orders and satisfaction with packaging quality and delivery speed.

Danfe differentiates itself by committing to purity at every step: sourcing from farmers, avoiding any adulteration, and packaging in a way that maintains the food’s natural goodness. The brand’s philosophy centers on preserving nature’s integrity, as reflected in its tagline ''Purity preserved'' and its dedication to providing unadulterated, wholesome products.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Ethical sourcing of grains and spices", "Hygienic food packaging", "Food product manufacturing (lentils, flour, spices, ready-to-cook items)", "Direct-to-consumer online sales"], "industries": [], "materials": ["Chana Dal (chickpeas)", "Wheat flour (Atta)", "White Sesame Seeds", "Pani Puri (wheat-based)"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Ethically sourced directly from trusted farms", "No added colors, preservatives, pesticides, or chemicals", "Hygienic packaging that locks in freshness and nutrients", "100% natural, unadulterated product lines"], "facts_used": ["Headquarters: Harrisburg, Pennsylvania -> db", "Product categories: Lentils and Beans, Flour, Spices, Miscellaneous -> /", "Team members: Khada Dulal (CEO), Krishna Dulal (Managing Director), Keshav Dulal (Director of Products), Upendra Dulal (Director, Sales and Marketing), Hem Khatiwoda (Director of Operations), Tirtha Dulal (Accounts Manager), Santi Ram Acharya (Director of Logistics & Supply Chain), Sneh Sharma (Advisory Board), Bhupendra Khanal (Advisory Board), Nitin Shinde (Advisory Board) -> /about-us", "Ethical sourcing and hygienic packaging with no additives -> /about-us", "No added colors, preservatives, pesticides, or chemicals -> /", "Business entity: Indigo Foods USA LLC at 2323 Woodlawn Street, Harrisburg PA 17104 -> /"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "We do this by ethically sourcing the finest quality grains and spices from the choicest farms, and hygienically packaging them in a way that keeps their freshness and nutrients intact", "founded_year": "", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='danfe-foods' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
UPDATE companies SET description='Darlington Snacks, a family-owned commercial bakery, has operated from Indianapolis, Indiana since its founding in 1982. The privately held company has been passed down through generations, building a reputation for pre-baked, packaged snacks sold under the Appleways, Darlington, and Crave-N-Rave brands.

The bakery produces more than 70 varieties of cookies, crackers, bars, fruit snacks, and breakfast items, all individually wrapped and shelf-stable from a dedicated nut-free facility. A dedicated team continuously develops and tests new recipes to meet evolving customer preferences.

Primary customers include daycare centers, K-12 schools, and healthcare facilities. For daycares, the company offers CACFP-certified snacks; for schools, Buy American Certified products that are nut-free, egg-free, and free of artificial flavors, colors, and preservatives; for healthcare, dye-free, nut-free items suited for patient trays and on-the-go service.

