UPDATE companies SET description='Based in Butler, Indiana, DeKALB Molded Plastics has operated for over three decades as a custom structural foam molder.

DeKALB specializes in large, multi-nozzle plastic products using structural foam molding and gas assist molding, with press capacities ranging from 300 to 750 tons. Its in-house value-added operations include post-mold painting, plastic decorating, kitting, assembly, inventory management, fabrication, and labeling. The company also offers custom injection molding, engineering support, and advanced quality planning with statistical process control.

The company serves industrial markets and everyday household applications. Long-term customers include Sauder Manufacturing, Follett (a partner since 2002), EnerSys, Trinity, Fuji, Invivo, PolyFlex Products Inc., T.H.E.M. International, and Signature Fencing & Flooring, reflecting a base that spans furniture, material handling, battery, fencing, and medical sectors.

DeKALB distinguishes itself as the first U.S. company to achieve ISO 9002 certification, now holding ISO 9001:2015. It emphasizes responsive customer service, direct engineering support, and innovative process control techniques to deliver medium-to-large components with flexibility. The firm''s mission extends beyond on-time delivery to community giving and sustainable outcomes.', certifications=ARRAY['ISO 9001:2015','ISO 9002 (first U.S. company)']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Structural Foam Molding", "Gas Assist Molding", "Custom Injection Molding", "In-house Post-Mold Painting", "Plastic Decorating", "Kitting", "Structural Foam Assembly", "Inventory Management", "Fabrication", "Labeling", "Engineering Support", "Advanced Quality Planning (AQP)", "Statistical Process Control", "Gage R&R Studies", "Dimensional Layout", "Color Measurement System"], "industries": ["Industrial", "Household/Consumer", "Structural Plastics"], "materials": ["Glass-filled structural foam", "Engineered resin structural foam", "Hot stamp structural foam plastics"], "equipment": ["Presses ranging from 300 to 750 tons"], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["First U.S. company to achieve ISO 9002 certification (now ISO 9001:2015)", "Press capacity from 300 to 750 tons", "In-house post-mold painting and plastic decorating", "Direct engineering support and innovative process control", "Responsive customer service with expedited part capabilities"], "facts_used": ["Location: Butler, Indiana -> db", "Over 30 years experience -> /about", "First U.S. company to achieve ISO 9002 certification -> /about", "ISO 9001:2015 certification -> /about, /quality", "Presses range from 300 to 750 tons -> /about", "Value-added services: in-house post-mold painting, plastic decorating, kitting, structural foam assembly, inventory management, fabrication, labeling -> /about", "Processes: structural foam molding, gas assist molding, custom injection molding -> /, /about", "Industr