UPDATE companies SET description='Diabetic Equipment and Supplies (DES) operates from Johnston, Iowa, with an additional location in Indiana, serving customers across 26 states.

DES distributes diabetes management equipment, including insulin pumps, continuous glucose monitors (CGMs), and glucometers. The company assigns each patient a dedicated Patient Care Coordinator who handles the entire ordering process, works with Medicaid, Medicare, and commercial insurance plans, and manages recurring resupply shipments with no shipping fees. Coordinators specialize exclusively in diabetes products and insurance navigation.

The company serves individuals with Type 1 and Type 2 diabetes, as well as endocrinologists, healthcare providers, diabetes educators, and other medical professionals. Its service area spans 26 states, with outreach conducted via phone, text, and email for resupply reminders and personal follow-up.

DES emphasizes a relationship-based model: calls are answered by a live person without phone trees, and coordinators proactively contact patients when supplies are due. The firm states that its staff works with diabetes products 100% of the time, positioning them as specialists in both product selection and insurance coordination.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Diabetic equipment distribution", "Insurance verification and billing", "Patient care coordination", "Resupply management", "Product education and support"], "industries": ["Diabetes management", "Medical equipment supply", "Healthcare", "Durable medical equipment (DME)"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Dedicated Patient Care Coordinator assigned to each patient for the entire process", "Live phone support with no automated phone trees or hold times", "Free shipping on all resupply orders", "Patient Care Coordinators specialize 100% in diabetes products and insurance (Medicaid, Medicare, commercial)", "Proactive resupply outreach via phone, text, or email with personal follow-up if no response"], "facts_used": ["Company name: Diabetic Equipment and Supplies (DES) -> db", "Headquarters: Johnston, Iowa -> db", "Additional location in Indiana -> page \"/\"", "Serves 26 states -> page \"/\"", "Provides insulin pumps, CGMs, glucometers -> page \"/\"", "Assigns dedicated Patient Care Coordinator per patient -> page \"/\"", "Works with Medicaid, Medicare, commercial insurance -> page \"/\"", "No shipping fees on resupply -> page \"/\"", "Live phone support, no phone trees -> page \"/\"", "Proactive resupply outreach via phone, text, email with personal follow-up -> page \"/\"", "Serves patients with Type 1 and Type 2 diabetes, endocrinologists, providers, educators -> page \"/\"", "Staff works with diabetes products 100% of the time -> page \"/\"", "Relationship-focused model -> page \"/\"", "Phone number , hours weekday