UPDATE companies SET description='DigitTron Technologies Inc. is an electronic manufacturing services provider headquartered in Shawnee, Kansas, a suburb of Kansas City. Founded in 2011, the company was co-founded by Victor Turnbaugh and became a subsidiary of Pivot International in 2016, gaining access to a global network with offices in the UK, Hong Kong, and manufacturing facilities in Asia.

The company operates a 13,800-square-foot humidity-controlled facility where it provides surface-mount assembly, conventional through-hole assembly, X-ray inspection, box-build integration, potting, and conformal coating. Its staff of industrial designers, engineers, technicians, and assemblers follows IPC workmanship standards and handles both prototype and full production runs.

DigitTron serves customers in telecommunications, medical devices, agriculture, transportation, lighting, and general industrial markets.

