UPDATE companies SET description='E2 Solar, LLC is a small solar installation company based in Bend, Oregon. Founded in 2005, the firm has spent nearly two decades serving Central Oregon residents, businesses, builders, general contractors, nonprofits, and government agencies with solar photovoltaic and energy storage systems.

Its in-house licensed electrical contractors perform all wiring and inverter connections, and crews set up monitoring systems to track production. In 2025, E2 Solar installed 1.4752 megawatts of solar capacity, doubling its prior-year volume, and earned its 11th consecutive appearance on Solar Power World''s Top Solar Contractors list.

Customers range from homeowners seeking resilience against outages to commercial property owners and public-sector clients navigating Oregon''s incentive programs. The firm regularly coordinates with the Energy Trust of Oregon and the Oregon Department of Energy to secure rebates and tax credits for clients, and its local knowledge of utility net-metering rules shapes system sizing recommendations.

