UPDATE companies SET description='EDL Packaging, a Massman Company, is based in De Pere, Wisconsin. The business draws on over six decades of experience in the shrink wrapping and multi-packing industry, though a specific founding year is not disclosed. It operates as part of the Massman Companies group, which bundles several packaging machinery brands under common ownership.

The company designs and builds flexible secondary packaging equipment for bundling consumer and industrial products in low-density polyethylene (LDPE) film. Its core product line includes shrink wrappers, shrink bundlers, roll wrappers, automatic flight bar wrappers, forming shoe wrappers, tray formers, and loaders. Both standard and custom-engineered machines are offered, with specific models such as the SV342 wrap-around tray former, SV346 twin-stream flight bar wrapper, and SV348 double tight wrap servo system.

EDL serves a range of industries including pet food, building materials, food, beverage, personal care, carpet and underlayment, grain, and medical/pharmaceutical. The broader Massman portfolio adds unscramblers, liquid fillers, pouch fillers, cappers, lidders, cartoners, case packers, and palletizers through partner divisions such as Massman Automation, Ideal Pase, DTM Packaging, New England Machinery, and ADCO Manufacturing.

EDL emphasizes safe, efficient, high-quality machinery design and aims to deliver the most reliable equipment in its field. The company highlights comprehensive turn-key system engineering, quick installation, smooth startup, and the convenience of a single agreement for all machines on a production line through the Massman Companies network.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Shrink wrapping", "Shrink bundling", "Roll wrapping", "Automatic flight bar wrapping", "Forming shoe wrapping", "Tray forming", "Automated loading", "Custom machinery engineering", "Turn-key packaging system integration", "Installation and startup support", "Unscrambling", "Liquid filling", "Pouch filling", "Capping", "Lidding", "Cartoning", "Case packing", "Palletizing", "Conveyor systems", "Shrink tunnel integration"], "industries": ["Pet Food", "Building Materials", "Food", "Beverage", "Personal Care", "Carpet and Underlayment", "Grain", "Medical/Pharmaceutical", "Food Service"], "materials": ["Low-Density Polyethylene (LDPE) film"], "equipment": ["Shrink Wrappers", "Shrink Bundlers", "Roll Wrappers", "Automatic Flight Bar Wrappers", "Forming Shoe Wrappers", "Tray Formers", "Loaders", "Double Tight Wrap Bundler", "Heat Tunnel", "Single Roll-Roll Wrapper", "SV342 Wrap Around Tray Former", "SV346 Twin Stream Flight Bar", "SV348 Double Tight Wrap Servo", "Tray Systems (Tray Wrappers & Tray Erector/Loaders)", "Intermittent Motion Wrappers (Side Feed, Roll Wrapper, Inline, Forming Shoe & Flight Bar Wrappers)", "Semi-Automatic Wrappers", "Specialty Ancillary (Shrink Tunnels, Conveyors, Ancillary Equipment)", "Tight Wrappers (Single and Double Tight Wrap)", "Continuous Motion Wrappers (Single Roll & Constant Motion Wrappers)", "Unscramblers", "Liquid Fillers", "Pouch Fillers", "Cappers", "Lidders", "Cartoners", "Case Packers", "Palletizers"], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Over six decades of experience in shrink wrapping and multi-packing