UPDATE companies SET description='Electro Circuits is a printed circuit board manufacturer based in Stafford, Texas. The company was founded in 2005 and has accumulated over two decades of experience in PCB design, fabrication, and assembly.

The shop produces single-sided, double-sided, and multi-layer boards up to 20 layers and beyond, working with materials such as polyamide, Teflon, Rogers, and flex/rigid-flex constructions. It offers PCB design, fabrication, and turnkey assembly services, including quick-turn prototypes and high-volume production runs. Finishes include ENIG, ENEPIG, silver, and carbon, all compliant with RoHS requirements. Every board undergoes electrical testing before shipment.

Long-term clients include REI and PMQ Alternatives, Inc., both of which have relied on the company for more than 20 years for PCB design, manufacturing, and assembly.

The company emphasizes domestic production—"Made in U.S.A."—and promotes fast turnaround times with minimal customer interaction. A customer testimonial notes that orders are placed and forgotten, with boards arriving on time without technical holds or handholding. Competitive pricing is offered for both domestic and international manufacturing options.', certifications=ARRAY['ISO 9001:2015','ITAR','RoHS']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["PCB design", "PCB fabrication", "PCB assembly (turnkey)", "Quick-turn prototyping", "High-volume production", "Electrical testing", "Controlled impedance boards", "Multi-layer fabrication (up to 20+ layers)", "Flex and rigid-flex PCB fabrication", "Single-sided PCB fabrication", "Double-sided PCB fabrication", "Special long length & width PCB", "ENIG plating", "ENEPIG plating", "Silver finish", "Carbon finish", "RoHS compliant materials", "ITAR compliance", "MILSPEC compliance", "UL certification"], "industries": [], "materials": ["Polyamide", "Teflon", "Rogers", "Flex", "Rigid Flex", "Kapton", "Gold", "Palladium", "ENIG", "ENEPIG", "Silver", "Carbon"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Made in U.S.A. manufacturing option", "Fast turnaround with minimal customer interaction", "Competitive pricing for domestic and international production", "ITAR registered and MILSPEC capable", "UL-certified PCBs and RoHS compliant materials"], "facts_used": ["Company name: Electro Circuits -> db", "Headquarters: Stafford, Texas -> db and /", "Founded year: 2005 -> db", "Certifications: ISO 9001:2015, ITAR, RoHS -> db and /", "Services: PCB design, fabrication, assembly, quick-turn, prototyping, high-volume, electrical testing, controlled impedance, multi-layer up to 20+, flex/rigid-flex, special long length/width -> /", "Materials: Polyamide, Teflon, Rogers, Flex, Rigid Flex, Kapton, gold, palladium, ENIG, ENEPIG, silver, carbon -> /", "Differentiators: Made in USA, fast turnaround, competitive pri