UPDATE companies SET description='Eckart Supply, formerly known as Chapman Electric Supply, operates a retail and distribution location in Noblesville, Indiana. The business traces its roots to Chapman Electric Supply, which was rebranded under the Eckart Supply name; the founding year and original founders are not publicly disclosed. The company functions as a subsidiary of EckartSupply.com, which serves as its parent e-commerce platform.

The Noblesville facility stocks a broad range of electrical and underground utility products, including conduit, pipe, vaults, hand tools, power tools, and safety equipment. In addition to product sales, the location maintains an on-site service department staffed by trained technicians who perform repairs and maintenance on tools and equipment. Inventory spans brands such as Milwaukee Tools, Klein Tools, Greenlee, Blue Diamond Industries, Copperhead Industries, and numerous other manufacturers serving the electrical and underground construction markets.

The product assortment targets applications in power distribution, communications (including FTTA and CATV), intelligent transportation systems, and general industrial projects.

