UPDATE companies SET description='Ehmke Manufacturing Co. Inc. has operated from Philadelphia, Pennsylvania, since its founding in May 1929 by Howard Ehmke.

The 50,000-square-foot, single-floor facility houses a range of equipment including single- and double-needle sewing machines, box and bar tackers, computer-aided cutting tables, fabric welding machines, and grommet presses. These assets support LEAN production lines that produce thermal-acoustic blankets, soft-sided cases, bags, tarpaulins, covers, safety harnesses, straps, and web assemblies. The company reports having manufactured over 8,000 distinct products for the defense sector.

Customers include the U.S. Armed Forces, allied militaries, defense contractors, and commercial OEMs. Notable programs include thermal-acoustic blankets for Boeing CH-47 Chinook and V-22 Osprey rotorcraft, and fabric components for the Mobile Kitchen Trailer. The firm is registered in SAM for government contracting and holds HUBZone certification.

Ehmke differentiates itself through its quality system—ISO 9001:2015 and AS 9100:2016 registration, rare in the textile industry—and a staff that collectively holds all three IFAI professional certifications. In 2026 the company launched a 22-project AI roadmap targeting proposal generation, inventory visibility, and shop-floor scheduling to reduce lead times and increase capacity.', certifications=ARRAY['ISO 9001:2015 (Certificate #13828)','AS 9100:2016 (Certificate #13828)','Mil-I-45208','Statistical Process Control – US Government Certified (1993)','IFAI Master Fabrics Craftsman Certification','IFAI Industrial Fabrics Manager Certification','IFAI Certified Project Planner Certification','HUBZone']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Engineering support services & prototyping", "Technical fabric manufacturing", "Single-needle sewing", "Double-needle sewing", "Box tacking", "Bar tacking", "Computer-aided cutting", "Fabric welding", "Grommet installation", "Press operations", "Punch operations", "LEAN manufacturing", "Operator cross-training program", "Thermal-acoustic blanket fabrication", "Soft-sided case fabrication", "Bag fabrication", "Tarpaulin fabrication", "Cover fabrication", "Safety harness fabrication", "Strap and web assembly fabrication", "Reverse engineering", "AI-assisted proposal generation", "AI-assisted inventory management", "AI-assisted shop floor scheduling"], "industries": ["U.S. Armed Forces", "Defense industry", "Commercial OEMs", "Industrial applications", "Aerospace (rotorcraft)", "Government contracting", "Tactical gear", "Field kitchen equipment"], "materials": [], "equipment": ["Commercial, industrial, paraloft and military sewing machines (single- and double-needled)", "Box and bar tackers", "Computer-aided cutting tables", "Various presses and punch machines", "Fabric welding machines", "Grommet machines"], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["ISO 9001:2015 and AS 9100:2016 registered (one of few in textile industry)", "Staff hold all three IFAI professional certifications (Master Fabrics Craftsman, Industrial Fabrics Manager, Certified Project Planner)", "50,000 sq ft LEAN manufacturing facility with computer-aided cutting and fabric welding", "22 AI-driven operational improvements for scheduling, inventory, and proposal development", "HUBZone certified and SAM-registered for government contracting"], "facts_used": ["Founded May 1929 -> /about-us", "Headquarters Philadelphia, Pennsylvania -> db", "50,000 sq ft single-floor facility -> /about-us", "ISO 9001:2015 and AS 9100:2016 certified -> /about-us", "Over 8,000 products for defense industry -> /capabilities", "Staff hold three IFAI certifications -> /capabilities", "AI roadmap with 22 projects -> /capabilities", "Government contracting registered in SAM -> /", "HUBZone certified -> /about-us", "Boeing CH-47 and V-22 thermal-acoustic blankets -> /about-us", "Mobile Kitchen Trailer fabric components -> /about-us", "Engineering support services and prototyping -> /capabilities", "LEAN manufacturing -> /capabilities", "Computer-aided cutting tables, sewing machines, fabric welding machines -> /capabilities", "Founder Howard Ehmke -> /about-us"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "Ehmke Manufacturing Company, Inc. has engineered and fabricated a diverse range of technical fabric products", "founded_year": "1929", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": ["HUBZone"]}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='ehmke-manufacturing-co-inc' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
